I've finished painting.

18
00:00:54,150 --> 00:00:55,420
It's time to go.

19
00:00:57,210 --> 00:00:58,640
Are you really leaving?

20
00:00:59,030 --> 00:01:01,350
It's only been a month since you arrived.

21
00:01:01,570 --> 00:01:04,870
Can't you stay until the interschool tournament?

22
00:01:05,350 --> 00:01:08,350
I'm sure we'd win if you were here.

23
00:01:08,790 --> 00:01:11,640
I can't help it. My father's job is like this.

24
00:01:11,790 --> 00:01:12,840
Come on...

25
