Crack of Dawn 5:17

59
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:14,840
You...

60
00:03:17,150 --> 00:03:20,220
Episode 5: The Road to the Interschool Tournament
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
www.areyousuresubs.com

61
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:21,870
Come on, come on. What's wrong?

62
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:25,110
If you can't even take this ball from me...

63
00:03:25,430 --> 00:03:27,560
...you'll never win against Shutetsu in the tournament.

64
00:03:33,430 --> 00:03:34,520
What's wrong? What's wrong?

65
00:03:36,150 --> 00:03:38,360
- Come on. One more time.
- Okay!

66
00:03:47,630 --> 00:03:49,940
# Ozora #

67
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:53,560
Mom! I'm home!

68
00:03:54,220 --> 00:03:56,840
Welcome back. Breakfast is ready.

69
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:57,590
Okay.

70
00:03:59,630 --> 00:04:00,800
Good morning.

71
00:04:00,940 --> 00:04:02,220
Good morning, Roberto.

72
00:04:02,710 --> 00:04:06,190
Sorry for making you deal with him at the crack of dawn.

73
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,030
No problem.

74
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,710
When it comes to football, he really...

75
00:04:09,870 --> 00:04:11,710
...sees nothing else.

76
00:04:12,110 --> 00:04:13,750
It's impossible to tell him something's impossible.

77
00:04:14,150 --> 00:04:14,870
No.

78
00:04:15,190 --> 00:04:18,390
Actually, I was the one who suggested morning training.

79
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,680
Really?

80
00:04:21,110 --> 00:04:22,470
Then it's fine, but...

81
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:26,000
You don't need to worry about my eyes.

82
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,070
What?

83
00:04:27,070 --> 00:04:29,510
You saw my medical report, right?

84
00:04:30,750 --> 00:04:33,830
I'm sorry. I couldn't help myself.

85
00:04:34,270 --> 00:04:35,870
# Medical Certificate
For Mr. Roberto Hongo #

86
00:04:39,070 --> 00:04:41,230
The real reason I came to Japan...

87
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:45,800
...was because there was an eye specialist Captain Ozora recommended to me.

88
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:48,800
You know the results.

89
00:04:49,230 --> 00:04:51,230
I can never step onto a football pitch again.

90
00:04:53,070 --> 00:04:55,920
I've informed Brazil of my intention to retire.

91
00:04:57,230 --> 00:05:00,230
But I have no qualms about being just a coach.

92
00:05:01,270 --> 00:05:04,720
Besides, teaching Tsubasa things right now brings me great joy.

93
00:05:05,390 --> 00:05:08,360
Tsubasa is truly remarkable.

94
00:05:09,070 --> 00:05:11,160
The more I teach him, the better he gets.

95
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:15,070
If I keep training him, I can even forget about my eyes.

96
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,230
Roberto...

97
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:20,560
I'm not pushing myself too hard.

98
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:25,040
I'm heading out!

99
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:35,110
Sorry.

100
00:05:44,270 --> 00:05:46,510
Not that way, man!

101
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,720
Big news! Big news!

102
00:05:49,310 --> 00:05:52,720
I have to tell everyone right away!

103
00:06:01,270 --> 00:06:02,000
Alright.

104
00:06:27,390 --> 00:06:29,000
Man...

105
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:36,000
So let's begin the first lesson.

106
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:38,680
In our previous lesson...

107
00:06:38,830 --> 00:06:40,940
...everyone picked a book they liked from the library.

108
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:43,040
However, some of you...

109
00:06:43,870 --> 00:06:46,310
It was obvious Manabu would be late.

110
00:06:46,470 --> 00:06:48,870
He's terrible at dribbling.

111
00:06:50,830 --> 00:06:53,310
Ishizaki-kun! Tsubasa-kun! I have important news!

112
00:06:59,750 --> 00:07:01,600
Oh, this kid...

113
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:06,720
Shutetsu Elementary is having a practice match?!

114
00:07:06,870 --> 00:07:08,110
Definitely.

115
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:12,270
Yesterday on the way home, I went by way of Mizukoshi Elementary.

116
00:07:12,830 --> 00:07:16,160
I heard the Mizukoshi Elementary soccer club members talking.

117
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:19,680
They said they're having a practice match with Shutetsu after school today.

118
00:07:20,750 --> 00:07:23,540
So you went all the way to Mizukoshi Elementary?

119
00:07:23,540 --> 00:07:25,230
That's on the other side of town.

120
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,920
I couldn't help it.

121
00:07:27,310 --> 00:07:29,920
The ball wasn't listening to me at all.

122
00:07:30,510 --> 00:07:34,270
But thanks to that, I was able to learn about the practice match.

123
00:07:35,630 --> 00:07:37,230
Let's go watch, Tsubasa.

124
00:07:37,390 --> 00:07:40,190
Since the interschool tournament is near, it would be good, right?

125
00:07:40,510 --> 00:07:41,160
Yes.

126
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:45,310
# Private Shutetsu Elementary #

127
00:07:45,470 --> 00:07:47,800
# Shutetsu Soccer Field #

128
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:52,110
So this is Shutetsu's field.

129
00:07:58,190 --> 00:08:02,000
This was to be expected. Look at the beauty of this field.

130
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:04,430
- Go!
- Press them!

131
00:08:04,870 --> 00:08:06,310
Go, Kurata!

132
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,430
They've already started.

133
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:14,000
What? Isn't that goalkeeper Wakabayashi-kun?

134
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:14,830
What?

135
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:16,720
It really is.

136
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:20,390
Wakabayashi won't be playing in this match.

137
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:22,630
Urabe!

138
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:25,600
I see. Nishigaoka Elementary came to watch the match too.

139
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:28,270
Do you know why Wakabayashi isn't playing?

140
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:33,720
I heard he hasn't even been coming to school, doing rigorous training at home every day.

141
00:08:33,870 --> 00:08:34,750
Rigorous training?!

142
00:08:35,150 --> 00:08:38,670
It seems conceding a goal to you really stung.

143
00:08:39,630 --> 00:08:44,150
Still, even without Wakabayashi, they'll easily beat pushovers like Mizukoshi.

144
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:49,000
Even though it's only the first half, the score is already 3-0!

145
00:08:49,510 --> 00:08:52,080
Mizukoshi wasn't such a weak team.

146
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:55,320
Shutetsu really is insanely strong.

147
00:08:55,630 --> 00:08:57,600
Go, Mizukoshi Elementary!

148
00:08:57,950 --> 00:08:59,550
Do your best!

149
00:09:04,750 --> 00:09:05,550
That's it, he got it!

150
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:07,950
It's wide open! Blast it from there!

151
00:09:09,950 --> 00:09:10,750
Got it!

152
00:09:22,030 --> 00:09:23,270
Takasugi Shingo.

153
00:09:23,790 --> 00:09:27,550
The main defender protecting Shutetsu's goal alongside Wakabayashi.

154
00:09:29,750 --> 00:09:31,550
Long pass coming!

155
00:09:32,030 --> 00:09:33,150
Nice pass!

156
00:09:35,270 --> 00:09:39,470
Playmaker. Midfielder Izawa Mamoru.

157
00:09:40,150 --> 00:09:40,910
I'll get it back!

158
00:09:45,390 --> 00:09:46,750
Run, Taki!

159
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:53,950
The one running on the wing is Shutetsu's forward, Taki Hajime.

160
00:09:58,270 --> 00:10:00,000
Kisugi, I'm leaving it to you!

161
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:02,200
Alright, leave it to me!

162
00:10:04,870 --> 00:10:09,200
And he's the main forward, Kisugi Teppei.

163
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,420
# Shutetsu: 4
Mizukoshi: 0 #

164
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:16,420
They call them the Shutetsu Quartet!

165
00:10:16,750 --> 00:10:18,420
The Shutetsu Quartet

166
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:22,670
Shutetsu's national championship wasn't only thanks to Wakabayashi.

167
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,470
They were there too.

168
00:10:25,110 --> 00:10:28,510
Damn it! Shutetsu is very strong this year too!

169
00:10:28,670 --> 00:10:30,390
They scored 4 goals in the blink of an eye.

170
00:10:30,750 --> 00:10:32,950
It's impossible to win against them.

171
00:10:33,470 --> 00:10:37,110
Shutetsu Elementary is amazing! They're worth beating!

172
00:10:37,110 --> 00:10:38,670
What?!

173
00:10:38,670 --> 00:10:39,870
Tsubasa?!

174
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:51,140
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
www.areyousuresubs.com

175
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:13,630
Next!

176
00:11:17,390 --> 00:11:18,030
Next!

177
00:11:19,790 --> 00:11:20,420
Next!

178
00:11:22,420 --> 00:11:24,390
Next! Keep it up!

179
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:30,420
You're slow, slow!

180
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:38,000
Come on!

181
00:11:46,870 --> 00:11:49,950
Tsubasa said they're worth beating.

182
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:52,230
I'd be happy if we could beat them, but...

183
00:11:52,510 --> 00:11:54,470
...if they press us like that too...

184
00:12:01,630 --> 00:12:02,870
Run, Taki!

185
00:12:03,510 --> 00:12:05,080
Kisugi, I'm leaving it to you!

186
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:13,840
And Wakabayashi is still doing some kind of training too.

187
00:12:14,870 --> 00:12:15,550
But...

188
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:17,550
I'll challenge him!

189
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:28,320
Not yet!

190
00:12:35,420 --> 00:12:37,110
Go!

191
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:41,840
We need to work hard too.

192
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:45,840
If we give up here, we'll go back to our old ways.

193
00:12:46,230 --> 00:12:47,110
Alright...

194
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:59,670
Come on, come on! What's wrong? What's wrong?

195
00:13:02,750 --> 00:13:04,360
You're pretty good.

196
00:13:05,390 --> 00:13:06,110
Come on, come on.

197
00:13:10,030 --> 00:13:10,790
I did it!

198
00:13:13,470 --> 00:13:13,950
How was it?

199
00:13:14,550 --> 00:13:17,320
You made pretty good decisions, Tsubasa.

200
00:13:17,910 --> 00:13:21,720
Alright, now let's do different curve shot practice.

201
00:13:21,870 --> 00:13:23,420
Tsubasa! Coach!

202
00:13:27,110 --> 00:13:30,150
This isn't fair, Coach! You're only training Tsubasa!

203
00:13:30,510 --> 00:13:32,600
We whined a lot yesterday, but...

204
00:13:32,750 --> 00:13:35,870
...we really want to win against Shutetsu too!

205
00:13:36,030 --> 00:13:37,390
Train us too!

206
00:13:37,870 --> 00:13:39,360
We'll come every day too!

207
00:13:39,670 --> 00:13:40,420
Guys...

208
00:13:42,670 --> 00:13:43,390
Alright!

209
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:45,110
Everyone take your positions.

210
00:13:46,110 --> 00:13:47,880
Until the tournament, you'll do special training.

211
00:13:47,910 --> 00:13:49,510
Okay!

212
00:13:56,750 --> 00:13:57,470
Tsubasa!

213
00:13:59,150 --> 00:14:03,700
You're putting too much power in your leg. Only put power in when you're about to shoot.

214
00:14:03,750 --> 00:14:04,390
Okay!

215
00:14:05,150 --> 00:14:06,340
Okay...

216
00:14:08,230 --> 00:14:08,910
Got it.

217
00:14:10,110 --> 00:14:12,630
If you think after receiving the ball, you'll be too late, Oda!

218
00:14:12,870 --> 00:14:13,360
Okay!

219
00:14:14,150 --> 00:14:18,630
Plant your foot firmly, then when you turn, push forward as well.

220
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:22,550
Plant firmly, push while turning.

221
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:26,030
It's the same as what you do with your hands. Give it a try.

222
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:27,150
Okay.

223
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:31,000
Plant firmly, as if scooping...

224
00:14:33,390 --> 00:14:35,790
Keep trying without giving up.

225
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:36,790
Okay.

226
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:40,470
Iwami!

227
00:14:42,150 --> 00:14:43,360
Look around more!

228
00:14:48,110 --> 00:14:49,630
- Faster!
- Okay!

229
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:50,870
Next!

230
00:14:54,790 --> 00:14:55,420
Next!

231
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:14,320
Plant firmly, as if scooping...

232
00:15:15,870 --> 00:15:16,720
I got it!

233
00:15:25,630 --> 00:15:26,390
Tsubasa!

234
00:15:49,950 --> 00:15:51,230
The big day is tomorrow.

235
00:15:54,600 --> 00:15:55,910
It feels amazing!

236
00:16:02,870 --> 00:16:03,420
Alright.

237
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:05,110
Plant firmly...

238
00:16:05,750 --> 00:16:07,720
...and as if lifting with your hands...

239
00:16:16,150 --> 00:16:17,790
I did it!

240
00:16:21,790 --> 00:16:22,670
Good morning!

241
00:16:25,510 --> 00:16:27,360
Even Manabu isn't late anymore.

242
00:16:27,670 --> 00:16:30,030
Everyone can now comfortably make it on time.

243
00:16:30,420 --> 00:16:33,950
Thanks to the practices the coach had us do.

244
00:16:34,390 --> 00:16:36,420
Let's definitely win tomorrow.

245
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:39,230
The soccer club members are really fired up.

246
00:16:39,470 --> 00:16:41,910
They used to give up without even trying.

247
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:44,630
They're saying they'll win this year.

248
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:47,870
I heard they practiced until they couldn't see the ball anymore.

249
00:16:49,470 --> 00:16:52,550
Still, what use is dribbling on the way to school?

250
00:16:52,950 --> 00:16:54,390
They're just showing off.

251
00:16:54,550 --> 00:16:55,470
- Hey!
- That hurt!

252
00:16:56,230 --> 00:16:59,080
I won't forgive anyone who makes fun of the soccer club!

253
00:16:59,270 --> 00:17:00,950
The cheer squad's Anego!

254
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:07,950
So cool today too!

255
00:17:10,470 --> 00:17:13,830
Tomorrow is the interschool tournament day! We'll practice until the very end!

256
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:15,000
Okay!

257
00:17:15,550 --> 00:17:17,350
With all your strength, everyone!

258
00:17:17,550 --> 00:17:19,860
Even that lousy soccer club is fired up!

259
00:17:20,030 --> 00:17:22,400
This year we'll win at all costs!

260
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:24,000
Principal.

261
00:17:24,430 --> 00:17:27,000
The students are more enthusiastic than ever.

262
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:29,680
Hora!

263
00:17:29,830 --> 00:17:32,920
Even the Nankatsu cheer squad won't stop chanting.

264
00:17:33,070 --> 00:17:34,510
Tsubasa!

265
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:35,470
What?!

266
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:38,720
Anego, enough with the Tsubasa already!

267
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:41,160
We should cheer for the other clubs too.

268
00:17:41,590 --> 00:17:42,680
Shut up!

269
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:44,640
Are you going against the cheer squad captain?!

270
00:17:45,070 --> 00:17:46,000
It's no use.

271
00:17:46,270 --> 00:17:47,950
You do it too.

272
00:17:48,830 --> 00:17:49,750
Quick!

273
00:17:50,100 --> 00:17:53,860
Hora! Hora! Tsubasa!

274
00:17:54,030 --> 00:17:55,270
Louder!

275
00:17:55,430 --> 00:17:59,160
Hora! Hora! Tsubasa!

276
00:18:05,230 --> 00:18:07,510
What? Tsubasa is going to be goalkeeper?

277
00:18:08,070 --> 00:18:09,230
Listen, Tsubasa.

278
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:12,310
This is my last lesson before the interschool tournament.

279
00:18:13,430 --> 00:18:14,470
I'm coming, Tsubasa!

280
00:18:16,750 --> 00:18:17,950
The coach is going to shoot?

281
00:18:24,720 --> 00:18:25,830
So fast.

282
00:18:26,030 --> 00:18:28,000
It's impossible for him to stop that...

283
00:18:28,270 --> 00:18:31,310
What happened, Tsubasa? At least try to react.

284
00:18:33,070 --> 00:18:33,750
Again!

285
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:37,750
Again!

286
00:18:39,400 --> 00:18:42,400
Tsubasa can't even touch the ball.

287
00:18:42,950 --> 00:18:46,070
We're being trained by an amazing person.

288
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:47,470
Unbelievable.

289
00:18:47,830 --> 00:18:50,640
These are the shots of a real professional.

290
00:18:59,070 --> 00:19:02,310
It truly is impossible to stop those shots.

291
00:19:04,950 --> 00:19:05,750
I understand.

292
00:19:06,350 --> 00:19:07,920
I understand the purpose of this training.

293
00:19:09,750 --> 00:19:10,720
Want another one?

294
00:19:12,720 --> 00:19:13,310
Sure!

295
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:17,310
# 26th Shutetsu Elementary - Nankatsu Elementary
Interschool Tournament #

296
00:19:17,350 --> 00:19:19,400
