300
00:19:32,070 --> 00:19:35,070
Even if it's Ozora Tsubasa who scored against the captain...

301
00:19:35,230 --> 00:19:37,000
...if we mark that one person, we'll take the match.

302
00:19:37,200 --> 00:19:39,550
I think so too, and then we'll win as usual.

303
00:19:41,950 --> 00:19:43,860
Alright, everyone, good work.

